[00:20.30]Gracious Jehovah, our strength and our might,
[00:30.00]You are our Savior, in you we delight.
[00:39.67]We are your Witnesses bearing your news,
[00:46.38]Whether men hear or they proudly refuse.
[00:51.93](Chorus)
[00:52.08]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[00:59.44]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[01:05.91]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[01:13.17]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.
[01:28.92]We who now serve you rejoice in your light;
[01:38.66]Eyes that are opened now see truth and right.
[01:48.19]Searching the Scriptures, we hear your command;
[01:55.10]Making our choice, for your Kingdom we stand.
[02:00.86](Chorus)
[02:01.01]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[02:08.06]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[02:14.50]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[02:21.64]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.
[02:54.22]Gladly, O God, we keep doing your will.
[03:02.10]Though Satan mocks us, we’re trusting you still.
[03:11.96]Though he may slay us, oh, help us to be
[03:18.54]Firm to the end for your grand Sov’reignty.
[03:23.85](Chorus)
[03:24.00]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[03:30.88]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[03:38.68]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[03:44.92]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.
